      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "For the month of January, we are taking over the street facing gallery space at Artscape Bayside for a unique creation. If you are a performance artist who would be interested in using time in the space to create a new site-specific work, we’d love for you to join us. Please apply below!   Submissio"
